'' TKO1206: the test program stopped before it ran a test -- a module whose initialiser ends it.
'' TEST: cli
'' HOSTS: windows
'' ENV: TIKO_MODCACHE=build/.tsc/cache
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' CLEAN: build/.tsc
'' COPY: tests/driver/src/test-early => build/.tsc/proj
'' ARGS: test -target windows-x86_64 build/.tsc/proj
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: error TKO1206: the test program
'' EXPECT-OUT: stopped before running a test (exit code 9)
